OL,3,GNEWSAWhy are people heading to cinemas 
OL,4,Ain cat ears?                           
OL,6,FOver an hour of back-to-back cat videos
OL,7,Fon a Saturday might sound like a       
OL,8,Fparticularly extensive doomscrolling   
OL,9,Fsession.                               
OL,11,FBut for years, audiences have been     
OL,12,Fpacking into cinemas to watch them as  
OL,13,Fpart of a festival spanning the world. 
OL,15,FCatVideoFest officially started in the 
OL,16,FUnited States during 2016, when curator
OL,17,FWill Braden pulled together his        
OL,18,Ffavourites into a feline-filled film.  
OL,19,FIn 2019, he started taking it to       
OL,20,Fcinemas across the country, and two    
OL,21,Fyears ago, it made its debut in the UK.
OL,23,APub: 21-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2 
