OL,3,GNEWSAWhy are people heading to cinemas 
OL,4,Ain cat ears?                           
OL,6,FAnd Erin Wiegand, from the             
OL,7,Fvolunteer-run Star and Shadow Cinema in
OL,8,FNewcastle, says attendees are lapping  
OL,9,Fit up like milk, to the point of       
OL,10,Fneeding three different showings.      
